# Digital Platform – Microservices + AI Streaming Chatbot

A **full-stack microservices-based digital platform** built using **Spring Boot, Angular, Eureka Service Discovery, API Gateway**, and **MySQL**, enhanced with a **local AI streaming chatbot** powered by **Ollama (Qwen2.5-Coder 7B)**.

    - Designed microservices architecture with Eureka & Gateway
    - Implemented CRUD operations using Hibernate & MySQL
    - Built AI streaming chatbot using local LLM
    - Integrated SSE for real-time responses
    - Full-stack ownership: Angular + Spring Boot

## 🚀 Key Features

### 🎬 Core Digital Services (Microservices)
    - Movie Management (CRUD)
    - Actor Management (Add / Update / Delete)
    - Movie Reviews & Ratings
    - Hibernate + MySQL persistence
    - RESTful APIs

### 🤖 AI Chatbot (New Feature)
    - Ask questions
    - Local LLM using **Ollama**
    - **Streaming responses (SSE)**
    - Secure, offline, privacy-friendly AI

