⚙️ Setup Instructions

   cd backend
   mvn spring-boot:run

1️⃣ Install & Run Ollama
   ```bash
   brew install ollama
   ollama serve
   ollama pull qwen2.5-coder:7b

2️⃣ Start Eureka Server
   cd discovery-server
   mvn spring-boot:run

3️⃣ Start API Gateway
   cd api-gateway
   mvn spring-boot:run

4️⃣ Start Microservices
   mvn spring-boot:run

5️⃣ Start Angular Frontend
   cd frontend-angular
   npm install
   ng serve

   Frontend URL:
   http://localhost:4200
